Hi Jeroen,

I am able to view RApacheInfo by putting this in httpd.conf.

<Location /RApacheInfo>
      SetHandler r-info
  </Location>

However I am not able to run R files from my directory in the document root by putting this in httpd.conf:

<Directory /var/www/html/rscripts>
  SetHandler r-script
  RHandler sys.source
</Directory>

Can you please guide me.

Regards,

Raj

